<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rental Service started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rental Service started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette has started coverage of Rental Service Corp with an outperform rating, a market source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 20-3/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
